### Teste da Rota Raíz
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1. Cadastrar Cliente 
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "48996054892"
}

###

### 1.1. Realizar login (Carlos)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rafael@gmail.com",
  "senha": "cba"
}

###

### 2. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Consultar cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Rafael",
  "email": "rafael@gmail.com",
  "senha": "cba",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "48996054892"
}

###

### 5. Apagar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/2
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

##################################

### Console

### 1. Cadastrar Console
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codCliente": "1",
  "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
  "marca": "Sony",
  "numSerie": "123"
}

###

### 2. Listar consoles
GET http://localhost:3000/consoles
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Consultar console
GET http://localhost:3000/console/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

####################################

### Agendamentos

### 1. Cadastrar Agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codCliente": "1",
  "codConsole": "1",
  "data": "2026-11-10",
  "hora": "14:30:00",
  "tipoServico": "Limpeza e troca de pasta térmica"
}

###

### 2. Atualizar agendamento
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codCliente": "1",
  "codConsole": "1",
  "data": "2026-11-25",
  "hora": "16:30:00",
  "tipoServico": "Limpeza e troca de pasta térmica"
}

###

### 3. Listar agendamentos
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json